-contente44dd2dd-1685-4947-9a55-1ebb151d96f0"> <section id="block-id-18" class="block-content-hero_block block block-block-content block-block-contente44dd2dd-1685-4947-9a55-1ebb151d96f0 block-hero-block clearfix"><h1><span class="field--name-field-header"><font color="#FFFFFF">Welcome to the National Snow and Ice Data Center</font></span></h1><div class="field field--name-field-associated-links field--type-link field--label-hidden field__items"><div class="field__item"><a href="/data/explore-data">Explore Data</a></div><div class="field__item"><a href="/our-research">Our Research</a></div></div><div class="field field--name-field-background-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div data-quickedit-entity-id="media/13661"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"></div></div></div> </section></div><div class="block-content-paragraph_block block block-block-content block-block-content6f707034-c79b-4673-b328-f0d7478f71f6"><h2>50 Years of Innovative Research, Trusted Data &amp; Real-World Impact</h2><div class="content"><div class="paragraph--story row field field--name-field-paragraph field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items"><div data-component-id="nsidc:card" class="nsidc-card nsidc-card--type--data-management-programs nsidc-card--view-mode--story col-md-4"><div class="paragraph--view-mode--story-wrapper"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div data-quickedit-entity-id="media/13837"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"> <picture> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/Logo/50_year_tile.png.webp?itok=pGyHmJRc 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 1200px)" type="image/webp" width="350" height="150"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_desktop/public/images/Logo/50_year_tile.png.webp?itok=kQfq3jL- 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="280" height="120"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_tablet/public/images/Logo/50_year_tile.png.webp?itok=P2Wec9-e 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="200" height="86"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_small/public/images/Logo/50_year_tile.png.webp?itok=gFRSqoky 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 360px)" type="image/webp" width="484" height="207"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/Logo/50_year_tile.png.webp?itok=pGyHmJRc 1x" type="image/webp" width="350" height="150"/> <img loading="lazy" width="350" height="150" src="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/Logo/50_year_tile.png.webp?itok=pGyHmJRc" alt="50th anniversary logo tile" title="50th anniversary logo tile" typeof="foaf:Image" /> </picture></div></div></div><div class="content-story-info"><h3 class="field field--name-field-title field--type-string"> <a href="/about/about-nsidc/what-we-do/50th-anniversary">Celebrate NSIDC&#039;s 50th Anniversary</a></h3><div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"> For a half a century, NSIDC has provided trusted information to support science, strengthen decision-making, and help communities respond to a changing environment.</div><div class="field field--name-field-link-to-url field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="/about/about-nsidc/what-we-do/50th-anniversary">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div><div data-component-id="nsidc:card" class="nsidc-card nsidc-card--type--data-management-programs nsidc-card--view-mode--story col-md-4"><div class="paragraph--view-mode--story-wrapper"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div data-quickedit-entity-id="media/2717"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"> <picture> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/banner-aurora-borealis-greenland.jpg.webp?itok=TkQqviw- 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 1200px)" type="image/webp" width="350" height="150"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_desktop/public/images/banner-aurora-borealis-greenland.jpg.webp?itok=jY2Tmjrt 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="280" height="120"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_tablet/public/images/banner-aurora-borealis-greenland.jpg.webp?itok=OdYsGLnu 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="200" height="86"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_small/public/images/banner-aurora-borealis-greenland.jpg.webp?itok=GX9a1YYv 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 360px)" type="image/webp" width="484" height="207"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/banner-aurora-borealis-greenland.jpg.webp?itok=TkQqviw- 1x" type="image/webp" width="350" height="150"/> <img loading="lazy" width="350" height="150" src="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/banner-aurora-borealis-greenland.jpg.webp?itok=TkQqviw-" alt="Northern lights over sea ice" title="Northern lights over sea ice" typeof="foaf:Image" /> </picture></div></div></div><div class="content-story-info"><h3 class="field field--name-field-title field--type-string"> <a href="/our-research/featured-projects">Research Collaborations that Matter</a></h3><div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"> Across the planet, snow and ice play a vital role in regulating Earth’s climate and providing freshwater resources to people, plants, and animals. That's why we study it.</div><div class="field field--name-field-link-to-url field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="/our-research/featured-projects">Explore featured research</a></div></div></div></div><div data-component-id="nsidc:card" class="nsidc-card nsidc-card--type--data-management-programs nsidc-card--view-mode--story col-md-4"><div class="paragraph--view-mode--story-wrapper"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div data-quickedit-entity-id="media/3407"><div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item"> <picture> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/ICESAT_greenland.jpg.webp?itok=eAaHgk4a 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 1200px)" type="image/webp" width="350" height="150"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_desktop/public/images/ICESAT_greenland.jpg.webp?itok=5XhQ7sW8 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/webp" width="280" height="120"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_tablet/public/images/ICESAT_greenland.jpg.webp?itok=yHIR_tb8 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 768px)" type="image/webp" width="200" height="86"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style_small/public/images/ICESAT_greenland.jpg.webp?itok=h3PW3hoW 1x" media="screen and (min-width: 360px)" type="image/webp" width="484" height="207"/> <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/ICESAT_greenland.jpg.webp?itok=eAaHgk4a 1x" type="image/webp" width="350" height="150"/> <img loading="lazy" width="350" height="150" src="/sites/default/files/styles/story_image_style/public/images/ICESAT_greenland.jpg.webp?itok=eAaHgk4a" alt="The Ice, Cloud and land Elevation Satellite (ICESat) image of the Greenland Ice Sheet from 2003 to 2006" title="The Ice, Cloud and land Elevation Satellite (ICESat) image of the Greenland Ice Sheet from 2003 to 2006" typeof="foaf:Image" /> </picture></div></div></div><div class="content-story-info"><h3 class="field field--name-field-title field--type-string"> <a href="/data/explore-data">Secure Stewardship of NASA, NOAA, and NSF Data</a></h3><div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"> We archive and distribute scientific data from Earth-observing satellites, airborne remote sensing campaigns, field studies and historical observations.</div><div class="field field--name-field-link-to-url field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="/data/explore-data">Explore NSIDC data</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-content-text_block block block-block-content block-block-content284eade6-2325-4f9b-96c1-0f027c686e42"><div class="content"><div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><h2 class="text-align-center"><font color="#FFFFFF">Select a geophysical measurement of interest</font></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="layout layout--onecol"><div class="layout__region layout__region--content"><div class="block block-nsidc-mobomo block-geophysical-measurement-tabs"><div class="content"><div id="geophysical-measurement-selectors" class="nav nav-tabs container slider-container" role="tablist"><div class="tab-item"> <a role="tab" class="modal-trigger selector-link" data-bs-toggle="modal" href="#Frozenground"> <?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="70" height="70" viewBox="0 0 70 70"><title>Frozen ground</title> <path fill="#fff" d="M105.274 47.5a35 35 0 1 0 35 35 35 35 0 0 0-35-35zM125.2 64.248q.842 3.19 1.717 6.37c.112.414 0 .59-.4.741-1.544.59-3.084 1.195-4.61 1.832a.525.525 0 0 1-.767-.238c-.979-1.486-1.976-2.969-2.962-4.451a.9.9 0 0 1-.194-.417c-.014-1.418-.011-2.836-.011-4.318h2.746c1.277 0 2.555.018 3.833-.007a.554.554 0 0 1 .648.488zm-23.726 19.767a5.407 5